om alpine forests and savannas to carribean reefs, each biome will have its own unique set of plants, animals, and environmental challenges to discover and overcome.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109270/extras/a24fb5180ce8190797b7d549a3928dda.poster.avif?t=1765613638\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109270/extras/a24fb5180ce8190797b7d549a3928dda.webm?t=1765613638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109270/extras/a24fb5180ce8190797b7d549a3928dda.mp4?t=1765613638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109270/extras/3b55e20e1113bdd89a21387a2a17dd24.avif?t=1765613638\" width=1560 height=410 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Besides regular harmony and puzzle game modes, creative mode lets you build the land without limitations and photo mode allows you to capture and share your creations at the end of each session.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109270/extras/d8703d8b7f3f9cf84c2a15d7ecba576e.poster.avif?t=1765613638\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109270/extras/d8703d8b7f3f9cf84c2a15d7ecba576e.webm?t=1765613638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse